For a **flattened JWE JSON**, fields look like:
```json
{
  "protected": "...",
  "encrypted_key": "...",
  "iv": "...",
  "ciphertext": "...",
  "tag": "..."
}
```

You can turn that into compact form:
```csharp
string compact = $"{protectedHeader}.{encryptedKey}.{iv}.{ciphertext}.{tag}";
